<title>EGYPT: EGYPT SUEZ CEMENT H1 PROFIT UP.</title>
<headline>EGYPT SUEZ CEMENT H1 PROFIT UP.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the first half of the financial year 1997.</p>
<p>(All figures in Egyptian pounds with comparative figures from previous year):</p>
<p>				  30 June 97		30 June 96</p>
<p>    Net sales		 248,096,000	     236,730,000</p>
<p>    Production costs	109,928,000	     112,757,000</p>
<p>    Overheads		   6,839,000		 6,829,000</p>
<p>    Exceptional revenue	 359,000		    40,000</p>
<p>    Exceptional expenses	377,000		   114,000</p>
<p>    Profit before tax     158,510,000	     151,023,000</p>
<p>Full name is Suez Cement</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +578 3290/1 me ceh</p>
</text>
